      <data key="d2">The knife is described as a yellow-colored kitchen utensil featuring a metallic blade and a yellow handle. It is positioned horizontally and is primarily used for cutting purposes. Based on the information, it is likely a butter knife, categorized as a metal utensil suitable for kitchen tasks.</data>
