      <data key="d7">The Knife is characterized by its yellow color and features a metallic blade paired with a yellow handle. It is commonly used for cutting food items, particularly for slicing tomatoes during food preparation tasks. At the moment, the knife is positioned horizontally on the kitchen countertop, indicating that it is ready for use, but it is currently not in action.</data>
